OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,FA government minister has met with
OL,7,Fvolunteers and organisations involved
OL,8,Fin the clean-up of 17 tonnes of
OL,9,Fnurdles which spilled into the River
OL,10,FTyne.
OL,12,FMarine Minister Stephen Morgan visited
OL,13,Fthe Port of Tyne on Monday (10 August)
OL,14,Fto meet representatives including from
OL,15,Fthe Port, local authorities and the
OL,16,FEnvironment Agency more than three
OL,17,Fweeks on from a collision which led to
OL,18,Fthe plastic pellets entering the river
OL,19,Fand then the North Sea.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,FHe also went to Littlehaven Beach, in
OL,7,FSouth Shields, where he met with
OL,8,Fcommunity groups and volunteers
OL,9,Fhelping the recovery efforts.
OL,11,FMr Morgan said: "People in the North
OL,12,FEast rightly expect a strong,
OL,13,Fcoordinated response to this incident.
OL,14,FThat's why the government and the
OL,15,FEnvironment Agency have been working
OL,16,Fclosely with local partners since this
OL,17,Fserious pollution happened.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,F"I want to thank volunteers on the
OL,7,Fground, who are spending time every
OL,8,Fday clearing the beaches and recognise
OL,9,Fthe work of local leaders to bring
OL,10,Ftogether organisations and take
OL,11,Fnecessary action.
OL,13,F"Meeting the people at the forefront
OL,14,Fof the recovery effort is vital so we
OL,15,Fcan better understand the challenges
OL,16,Fthey face and help to ensure the clean-
OL,17,Fup happens as quickly and effectively
OL,18,Fas possible."
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,FJoined by Environment Agency chair
OL,7,FAlan Lovell, the minister heard
OL,8,Fdirectly from the team at the Port of
OL,9,FTyne and discussed actions being taken
OL,10,Fto protect the environment and restore
OL,11,Fimpacted coastal areas.
OL,13,FRecovery efforts following the
OL,14,Fpollution incident at the Port of Tyne
OL,15,Fon 19 July continue to be led by the
OL,16,FPort and local authorities, with Defra
OL,17,Fand the Environment Agency working
OL,18,Fclosely with partners to support
OL,19,Frecovery.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,FMr Morgan added: "The government and
OL,7,Fthe Environment Agency are assisting
OL,8,Flocal partners such as the Port of
OL,9,FTyne in any way we can, including a
OL,10,Fdeploying additional boats,
OL,11,Fmonitoring, providing resources from
OL,12,Felsewhere in the country and holding
OL,13,Fthe plastics industry to account."
OL,26,@nD@ROUuD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,FThe visit follows a call led by Mr
OL,7,FMorgan and Ports Minister Keir Mather
OL,8,Fon Friday (7 August) with key
OL,9,Fpartners, elected mayors and lead
OL,10,Fresponding organisations to discuss
OL,11,Frecovery progress and identify where
OL,12,Fadditional government support could
OL,13,Fassist local efforts.
OL,15,FThe minister also saw how the
OL,16,FEnvironment Agency is mobilising
OL,17,Fadditional drone surveys, vessels and
OL,18,Fspecialist response teams to
OL,19,Fstrengthen monitoring and support
OL,20,Ftargeted recovery operations.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,FHe was also informed that Community
OL,7,FOfficers are standing by for immediate
OL,8,Fdeployment to support affected
OL,9,Fcommunities with advice and
OL,10,Finformation.
OL,12,FDefra is also said to be working
OL,13,Fclosely with marine science experts at
OL,14,Fthe Centre for Environment, Fisheries
OL,15,Fand Aquaculture Science (Cefas) to
OL,16,Fstrengthen environmental monitoring
OL,17,Fand analysis in an effort to build a
OL,18,Fclearer picture of any impacts from
OL,19,Fthe incident and informing longer-term
OL,20,Frecovery efforts.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
