OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786630729
OL,3,CMinister visits coast to see impact of
OL,4,Cnurdle spill
OL,6,FThe government is also working to
OL,7,Fstrengthen protections around the
OL,8,Ftransportation of plastic pellets such
OL,9,Fas nurdles and reduce the risk of
OL,10,Fsimilar incidents occurring in future.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/8
